{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261015/photo/bkn-20261015223030976-1015_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261015234152\"/><p>消防救出車內被困人士。</p><p>今晚(15日)約10時，兩輛私家車及一輛巴士在觀塘繞道往油塘方向、近香港郵政大樓對開相撞，一名男司機被困車內，需要由消防人員救出。據悉，事故一共造成3人受傷。網上圖片顯示，其中一輛私家車橫亘路中，車頭頂住路壆，車尾則緊貼巴士。意外原因有待進一步調查。受事件影響，現場現已全線封閉。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T16:00:19.430806+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T14:30:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T15:57:48.622743+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T15:57:48.622743+00:00","content_hash":"df117c7178a8ce69f138e012a4ec6c42fbcddd65a888be7ea25f2a97821d0053","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}